{"title":"Legal Oversight and Business Registration","startsAt":"2026-11-16T18:00:00-05:00","endsAt":"2026-11-16T20:00:00-05:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"At some point the business has to become real on paper. This session will address the decisions that arise when choosing to operate as a sole proprietorship, a partnership or a corporation, as well as registering your business name in Ontario, understanding your obligations around HST, record-keeping and taxes. We'll also cover the protections new owners most often skip such as basic contracts, insurance, and how to protect your business name and brand. You'll leave knowing exactly which steps apply to you and roughly what each one costs. This session is general information, not legal or tax advice.\n\nThe program includes a short networking component, providing participants with an opportunity to connect with other entrepreneurs.\n\nPresented by Ryan Knight, TPL's 2026 [Entrepreneur in Residence](https://tpl.ca/programs-and-classes/featured/entrepreneur-in-residence/) (EIR) at Toronto Reference Library.\n\n**Registration via TPL website:** [https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a99b901d94765189bb97c31](https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a99b901d94765189bb97c31)\n**Drop-ins welcome until room capacity is reached.**\n\nAccessibility\nLive or automated closed captioning, sign language interpretation, intervenor services, or attendant services are available upon request. Please submit your request at least 2 weeks in advance to: [tpl.ca/accessibility-events](https://tpl.ca/accessibility/accessibility-supports/programs-and-events/?_gl=1*v83hy7*_ga*NDk5MDg2NTE1LjE3NjYwMDgxODQ.*_ga_G99DMMNG39*czE3NjkxMDY3NDMkbzE0JGcxJHQxNzY5MTA2ODM0JGozOCRsMCRoMA..).","venue":{"name":"Toronto Public Library - Toronto Reference Library","address":"789 Yonge St, Toronto, ON M4W 2G8, Canada, Toronto","lat":43.671806,"lng":-79.38682,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Toronto Public Library Small Business Networking Meetup","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/6/b/6/3/highres_536307491.jpeg"}